{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>They shall be ashamed.</b> They go in disgrace — the carvers who carved the idols. And they went in honor to those who sent them on their behalf, for צירים means emissaries, as ציר בגוים שולח [Obadiah 1:1]. And the meaning is that they go to their place."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:12.208456332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}